@startuml get-manager-coffee-chat-alimtalk-template
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/manager/v1/coffee-chat/alimtalk-template
caption CRB-78 · 알림톡 템플릿 목록 (이벤트당 1건, DB 저장본)

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ManagerCoffeeChatController" as Controller
participant "ManagerCoffeeChatService" as Service
participant "AdminAlimtalkTemplateRepository" as Repository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: GET /api/manager/v1/coffee-chat/alimtalk-template\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Controller: 통과
Controller -> Service: listAlimtalkTemplates()
Service -> Repository: findAll()
Repository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT * FROM alimtalk_template ORDER BY event
PostgreSQL --> Repository: rows
Repository --> Service: templates
note right of Service: 행은 마이그레이션이 현재 하드코딩된 2건(coffee_chat_requested, contact_shared)으로 채워 둠
Service --> Controller: AlimtalkTemplateDto[]
Controller --> Client: 200 { items: [{ event, tpl_code, title, message, button_name, updated_at }] }

@enduml
